cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite it as below."
title: "Calibrated Funnel Inference: history before models in confidence-gated cascades"
abstract: "A measured test and a reproducible toolkit for model cascades on local hardware. On 4,500 real requests routed to 10 departments, a deterministic lookup in 15,000 labelled past requests followed by a 1.5B-parameter local model matches a 7.6B-parameter model alone at about one ninth of the compute."
type: software
